CODE INCLUDED IN PGNIFY

src/pgnify/recogniser/chess_diagram_to_fen/ holds the reading code of Chess_diagram_to_FEN,
https://github.com/tsoj/Chess_diagram_to_FEN, at commit
3d751125357ebd47b91f6a8168e0b8d513fe7aae. Copyright (c) 2024 Jost Triller, under the MIT
licence in that folder's LICENSE. The README in that folder says what pgnify changed.


NOT INCLUDED

- The diagram reader's weights. `pgnify setup` downloads them from Chess_diagram_to_FEN's
  release 1.0, or copies them from a folder the user gives, and checks each file against the
  SHA-256 that src/pgnify/weights.py pins. pgnify does not distribute them.
- Books. pgnify reads only the files its user points it at, and its repository and packages
  hold no published book, no PGN made from one and no other text of one. The only book they
  hold, the test book data/fixtures/epub/pocket-primer/, was written as a test fixture and is
  dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.


